# 13. Required validation for every future visual change

Before declaring a visual or animation task complete, validate:

```text
Desktop:
1440 × 900

Tablet portrait:
768 × 1024

Tablet landscape:
1024 × 768

Phone:
390 × 844
393 × 852
430 × 932
```

Also test:

* Touch input
* Reduced-motion mode
* Opening and closing navigation
* Full homepage scroll
* Back navigation
* Orientation change
* Browser-bar movement
* Page visibility changes

Check:

* No horizontal overflow
* No animation skipped
* No stuck transforms
* No blank sections
* No duplicate scroll engine
* No premature animation completion
* No console errors
* No hydration errors
* No repeated video loading
* No excessive ScrollTrigger rebuilding
* All signature animation stages complete
* Desktop appearance remains unchanged unless requested

Run:

```bash
npm run lint
npm run build
```

