---

# Final decision rule

When choosing between visual quality and performance, do not blindly remove the effect.

Use this order:

1. Preserve the visual concept.
2. Preserve the choreography.
3. Reduce simultaneous work.
4. Replace expensive rendering with cheaper rendering.
5. Reduce detail only when necessary.
6. Remove an effect only when explicitly approved.

Every future edit must maintain a luxurious experience on desktop, tablet and real phones.
